<h1>Visiting the workshop</h1>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
    <h2>Where and when</h2>
    <p>
      We're open Monday to Saturday, 9am to 7pm. Just walk in no appointment needed for a first
      look at your bike.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
    <h2>What happens when you bring a bike in</h2>
    <p>
      We tag your bike with your name and phone, and put it on the rack. Simple jobs, like a flat
      tyre, usually go out the same afternoon. Anything bigger gets a proper look first: we'll call
      you with a diagnosis and a price before we touch it, and you decide whether to go ahead.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
